    {"id":"21.4","t":"Input / Output & Pipes","c":[">",">>","<","2>","2>>","2>&1","|","tee"],"note":"Concepts: stdin, stdout, stderr, file descriptors, pipelines, exit codes. Challenge: ek multi-stage command pipeline khud design karo."},
    {"id":"21.5","t":"Users & Permissions","c":["whoami","id","who","w","groups","passwd","sudo","su","chmod","chown","chgrp","umask","getfacl","setfacl"],"note":"Advanced: UID · GID · SUID · SGID · sticky bit · ACL · capabilities. Test: permission-denied scenario — guessing ke bina exactly KYUN denied hai determine karo."},
    {"id":"21.6","t":"Processes","c":["ps","top","htop","pgrep","pkill","kill","killall","jobs","bg","fg","nohup","nice","renice"],"note":"Advanced: lsof · fuser · strace. Process identify → parent-child → resource usage → open files → network correlate → troubleshoot."},
    {"id":"21.7","t":"System Information","c":["uname","hostname","hostnamectl","uptime","date","arch","lscpu","free","df","du"],"note":"Goal: ek fresh Linux host ka complete system profile generate karo."},
    {"id":"21.8","t":"Services & Boot","c":["systemctl","systemd-analyze","journalctl","service"],"note":"Status · start/stop/restart · enable/disable · logs · dependencies · failed services · boot analysis. Challenge: 'Service is down.' No instructions — root cause find karke recovery karo."},
    {"id":"21.9","t":"Networking","c":["ip","ss","ping","traceroute","dig","host","curl","wget","tcpdump"],"note":"Concepts: IP · subnet · gateway · routing · DNS · TCP/UDP · ports · sockets · interfaces · HTTP. Host-Ready Test: broken network — Interface → IP → Route → DNS → Port → Service → Application."},
    {"id":"21.10","t":"Package Management","c":["apt","apt-cache","dpkg","dnf","rpm"],"note":"Install · remove · update · search · package information · dependency troubleshooting · installed files identify karna. (Debian/Ubuntu + Fedora/RHEL)"},
    {"id":"21.11","t":"Storage","c":["df","du","lsblk","blkid","mount","umount","findmnt"],"note":"Concepts: partitions · filesystems · mount points · disk usage · inode usage. Challenge: 'Server disk full hai.' Root cause identify karo."},
    {"id":"21.12","t":"Archives & Compression","c":["tar","gzip","gunzip","zip","unzip","xz"],"note":"Archive create · extract · inspect · compression/decompression · safe handling of paths."},
    {"id":"21.13","t":"Search & Investigation","c":["find","grep","locate","which","whereis","type","command"],"note":"Test: 'Is machine par X kaha hai?' — appropriate search strategy khud select karo."},
    {"id":"21.14","t":"Environment & Shell","c":["env","printenv","export","unset","source","alias","unalias","type","command"],"note":"Master: $PATH · environment variables · shell configuration · aliases · functions · startup files."},
    {"id":"21.15","t":"Bash Mastery","c":["variables","conditions","loops","functions","arrays","arguments","exit codes","case","getopts","trap"],"note":"Aur samjho: $? · $1 · $@ · $# · $$ · $!  Final Challenge: ek useful Linux administration/investigation utility from scratch banao."},
    {"id":"21.16","t":"Git","c":["git init","git clone","git status","git add","git commit","git log","git diff","git branch","git switch","git merge","git stash","git restore"],"note":"Apne scripts aur projects Git ke through professionally maintain karo."},
    {"id":"21.17","t":"SSH","c":["ssh","ssh-keygen","ssh-add","scp","sftp"],"note":"Key authentication · host verification · SSH config · agent · remote commands · secure file transfer · jump hosts."},
    {"id":"21.18","t":"Logs & Monitoring","c":["journalctl","dmesg","tail","grep","less","watch"],"note":"Event → Timestamp → Process → User · Service → Network → Root Cause correlate karo."},
    {"id":"21.19","t":"Security Utilities & Concepts","c":["ss","lsof","find","ps","journalctl","systemctl","chmod","chown","sudo"],"note":"Concepts: least privilege · attack surface · exposed services · insecure permissions · secrets · authentication · authorization · logging · hardening."},
    {"id":"21.20","t":"Binary & Application Investigation","c":["file","strings","ldd","readelf","objdump","nm","strace","ltrace"],"note":"Binary ko blindly execute karne ke bajay uske basic structure aur behavior ko safely inspect karo."},
    {"id":"21.21","t":"Containers","c":["images","containers","volumes","networks","environment","isolation"],"note":"Linux concepts: namespaces · cgroups · capabilities · root/rootless · filesystem isolation."},
    {"id":"21.22","t":"Documentation Mastery","c":["man command","command --help","info command","apropos keyword"],"note":"Golden Rule: Unknown command ≠ blocked. Unknown command ka matlab = 'Now investigate the documentation.'"},
    {"id":"21.23","t":"Command Chaining Mastery","note":"Final challenge mein individual commands nahi, workflow design karo: Collect → Filter → Transform → Sort → Deduplicate → Analyze → Report. Isse Linux ka Unix philosophy practically samajh aayega."},
    {"id":"21.24","t":"Host-Ready Simulation","note":"Missions: 1. Identify (whoami/uname/arch/hostname) · 2. Understand (fs/users/permissions/processes/services) · 3. Network (interfaces/IP/routes/DNS/listening/HTTP) · 4. Diagnose (random failures) · 5. Automate (Bash/Python utility) · 6. Investigate (authorized lab) · 7. Report (Problem→Evidence→Analysis→Root Cause→Fix→Verification→Recommendation). No predefined tutorial."}
